    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "honestly it's just exhausting. being \"here\" feels like a punishment. i look at his side of the bed and i just think... it would be so much easier to just be with him. like if i could just close my eyes and stop feeling this hollow ache. why is the only way to find peace to just keep suffering through this?",
